  "historyNote": "#7884-A, eff 5-2-03, EXPIRED: 5-2-11 New. #9921, eff 5-3-11; ss by #10909, eff 8-8-15 (from Puc 2102.12); ss by #14556, eff 4-15-26, EXPIRES: 4-15-36 (formally Puc 2012.10)",
